# Runtime directories are kept by a .gitignore inside each one (Laravel's own
# convention) rather than by patterns here. A pattern like /storage/logs/* matches
# the placeholder as well as the contents, so git records nothing and the directory
# is absent from a fresh clone. Laravel then fails with "View path not found" and
# every page returns 500.
